sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller (branch side or BranchSyncJob)
    participant SM as Yaghut session manager
    participant Y as Yaghut
    participant TP as Gateway token provider
    participant GS as Gateway token server
    participant Q as Inquiry or personnelInfo
    C->>SM: call Yaghut service
    alt no session, or sessionExpirationDate passed
        SM->>SM: ReentrantLock, one login for all waiting callers
        SM->>Y: POST /user/loginStatic (technical account from application.properties)
        Y-->>SM: JSESSIONID, sessionExpirationDate
    end
    SM->>Y: request with Cookie JSESSIONID only
    alt Invalid Session fault
        Y-->>SM: success false
        SM->>Y: login again once, then retry the call
    else Invalid Credentials fault (technical account)
        Y-->>SM: success false
        SM-->>C: configuration error, ops alert, no retry
    end
    Y-->>SM: response
    SM-->>C: result
    Note over C,Q: Gateway token, shared by the 9 inquiries and personnelInfo
    C->>TP: need token
    alt cached token missing or within 5 min of expiry
        TP->>GS: POST connect/token client_credentials (single flight)
        GS-->>TP: access_token, expires_in 7200
    end
    TP-->>C: Bearer token
    C->>Q: call with Authorization Bearer
    alt 401
        Q-->>C: 401
        C->>TP: evict token, fetch new one once, retry
    end
    Q-->>C: response
